cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this interface, please cite it as below, together with NewtonX and TeraChem (see references)."
title: "NewtonX-TeraChem interface for nonadiabatic dynamics"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Matsika-Lab/newtonx-terachem-interface"
url: "https://github.com/Matsika-Lab/newtonx-terachem-interface"
abstract: >-
  Perl interface between the NewtonX surface-hopping program and the TeraChem
  electronic-structure package. It provides energies, gradients and nonadiabatic
  coupling vectors for CASSCF, FOMO-CASCI, TDA/TDDFT and hh-TDA, supports
  time-dependent Baeck-An couplings, and computes vertical excitations for
  initial conditions and absorption spectra.
keywords:
  - nonadiabatic dynamics
  - surface hopping
  - NewtonX
  - TeraChem
